5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about our reporting integrity. Who can verify the numbers before we close?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The narrative of our past wins feels detached from reality. We need to check retention.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,Cash flow is tight. I need to know what follow-on calls will demand from us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,We spend too much time sourcing people. I want to see recruiter placement times.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Past projects failed due to external delays. I need to understand the delivery risks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
