35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The audit added six weeks for hardware appraisals. That is unacceptable for our quarter-end.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Retention was strong for practice and field tools, but weak for shopkeeper software.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,The credit line ignores subscription contracts. We cannot borrow against our main assets.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,Recruiters can't place field crews quickly. That is a major bottleneck for physical ops.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Hardware deals took three quarters in security review. Software was much faster.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if subscriptions are worthless to lenders, our liquidity is dangerously low.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, the security review delay explains the late arrivals. It is a compliance issue.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, I am concerned. We need assets that banks recognize, not just code.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, if the shopkeeper tool lost customers, why did we keep it in the portfolio?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, the field crew issue is real. We need to avoid companies needing seasonal labor.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,I prefer software that doesn't require physical appraisals. It keeps our books clean.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I am leaning toward the clinic scheduler. It has proven retention and no hardware.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"I am worried about the harvest sensor. It has hardware, which means appraisal fees.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"I am hesitant about the fabric loop. It needs shift supervisors, which we can't hire.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about the harvest sensor's security review time. It will be slow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
