70,3,3,talk,Servas,,I stand by my vote for A. It respects our reporting integrity and speed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I stand by my vote for A. The retention metrics are the strongest signal we have.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
